# The bundles not committed with the rest of dist/: @dbml/core, 16 MB
# minified, the Excalidraw editor's page, 9 MB in 185 files, draw.io's web
# app, 115 MB unpacked from its release, and markdown export's converter, 4.5 MB
# of puppeteer and KaTeX, with the 580 styles and fonts it reads. None is
# poly's code, and CI and release build all from source. CodeSnap's page is a
# copy of src/editor/codeSnap, and the Swagger preview's of src/editor/swaggerViewer
# with Swagger UI's files beside it.
extensions/lsp/dist/dbml.js
extensions/lsp/dist/excalidraw/
extensions/lsp/dist/drawio/
extensions/lsp/dist/markdownPdf.js
extensions/lsp/dist/markdown-pdf/
extensions/lsp/dist/codesnap/
extensions/lsp/dist/swagger/
extensions/lsp/.vscode-test/
# tools/*.py are scripts, never imported -- except that engine-diff's own
# self-test imports it to tamper with its EXPECTED table, and that writes here.
__pycache__/
